{
  "name": "HL · Error alerts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Error alerts (Lesson 3.6)\nThe one alarm for every Harvest Lane workflow. When an **automatic** run of a connected workflow fails, n8n starts this workflow; it formats the error data and sends Tolu a Telegram message with the workflow, node, error, time and a link to the run.\n\n**Credential:** Telegram API (the token from @BotFather), selected in Telegram alert (and in nothing else: never paste the token into a field).\n**Placeholder:** YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID (from https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates after you've messaged your bot; group IDs start with a minus sign). Don't save that address anywhere: it contains your token.\n\n**Then:** in every other workflow, Settings → Error workflow → HL · Error alerts. Manual runs never trigger it: test with HL · Alarm test.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "bb8c39b6-fddf-4700-9a5a-30398c1b7308",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -484,
        -234
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "121a3660-446a-4745-8dd4-2b8c3e995ced",
      "name": "Error Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
