      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Incidents sheet (switched off)\nLogs each failure for the Gold mission. To use it: make a tab **Incidents** with time · workflow · node · message · url · cause · fix · minutes_to_resolve, select a Google Sheets credential, replace YOUR_SHEET_ID, then re-enable the node (select it, press D).\n\nThe ?. and ?? in Format keep the alert useful even when the failure happens in a trigger and the data shape differs.",
